<report>
<title>Incidence rate difference (IRD) meta-analysis</title>
<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><th colspan="4">Table (a, person-time exposed, b, person-time not exposed)</th><th></th></tr>
<block name="inputs">
<tr><td>@st</td><td>@a</td><td>@{pt1:roundu}</td><td>@b</td><td>@{pt2:roundu}</td><td>@lb</td></tr>
</block>
</table>

<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><th>IRD</th><th colspan="2"><ci>@pc% CI (approximate)</ci></th><th></th></tr>
<block name="ir"><tr><td>@st</td><td>@{ird:roundu}</td><td><ci>@{lci:roundu}</ci></td><td><ci>@{uci:roundu}</ci></td><td>@lb</td></tr></block>
</table>

<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><th>Standardized effect</th><th>Variance</th><th colspan="2">% Weights (fixed, random)</th><th></th></tr>
<block name="ir"><tr><td>@st</td><td>@{yi:roundu}</td><td>@{vi:roundu}</td><td>@wt</td><td>@dwt</td><td>@lb</td></tr></block>
</table>

<subtitle>Fixed effects (inverse variance)</subtitle>
<p>Pooled IRD = @{rmh:roundu} (<ci>@pc% CI = @{from:roundu} to @{to:roundu}</ci>)<br />
Z (test IRD differs from 0) = @{z:roundu}  <pval>@{p_z:pval}</pval></p>

<subtitle>Non-combinability of studies</subtitle>
<p>Cohran Q = @{qc:roundu}  (df = @df)  <pval>@{xp:pval}</pval><br />
Moment-based estimate of between studies variance = @{tausq:roundu}<br />
I<sub>2</sub> (inconsistency) = @isq% (<ci>@pc1% CI = @llisq% to @ulisq%</ci>) </p>

<subtitle>Random effects (DerSimonian-Laird)</subtitle>
<p>Pooled IRD = @{dsird:roundu} (<ci>@pc% CI = @{dsll:roundu}  to  @{dsul:roundu}</ci>)<br />
Z (test IRD differs from 0) = @{dz:roundu}  <pval>@{dp:pval}</pval></p>

<block name="egger">
<subtitle>Bias indicators</subtitle>
<p>Begg-Mazumdar: Kendall's @tau  <pval>@{p2:pval}</pval><br />
Egger: bias = @a (<ci>@pc_egger% CI = @cl to @cu</ci>)  <pval>@{p:pval}</pval></p>
</block>
</report>
